/*
 * FXOS8700CQ 6-Axis Accelerometer / Magnetometer - Impact Logger
 * Board:  Raspberry Pi Zero W
 * Bus:    I2C bus 1 (GPIO2 = SDA, GPIO3 = SCL)
 * Library: pigpio (modern, actively maintained)
